#var, use command >Rest Client: Switch Environment in search bar of vs code
@id =1

###

### Get all courses
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/courses HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

###

### Get course by ID
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/courses/{{id}} HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

###

### Create a new course
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/courses HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Introduction to Programming",
  "description": "A beginner course on programming concepts.",
  "credits": 3,
  "contactHours": 45,
  "level": "Undergraduate",
  "schoolId": "644a1f2e5f1b2c001c8e4d3a"
}

###

### Update an existing course
PUT http://localhost:3000/api/v1/courses/{{id}} HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Advanced Programming",
  "description": "An advanced course on programming concepts.",
  "credits": 4,
  "contactHours": 60,
  "level": "Graduate",
  "schoolId": "644a1f2e5f1b2c001c8e4d3a"
}

###

### Delete a course
DELETE http://localhost:3000/api/v1/courses/{{id}} HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json
